### Connect module HTTP samples (for local debugging against a running host)

@host = https://localhost:5001
@inst = 1a6a5000-1920-45ec-9500-f37f54f82d5f

### SMS sent (paged)
GET {{host}}/api/connect/sms/sent?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Email sent
GET {{host}}/api/connect/email/sent?page=1&pageSize=20
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Send SMS (RecipientPostData shape)
POST {{host}}/api/connect/sms
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello from connect tests",
  "smsRefId": "http-test-1",
  "recipients": {
    "manual": ["9876543210"]
  }
}

### Send Email
POST {{host}}/api/connect/email
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "generic",
  "from": "noreply@test.local",
  "subject": "Test email",
  "html": "<p>Hello</p>",
  "to": ["student@example.com"]
}

### Contact lookup
POST {{host}}/api/connect/lookup
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contacts": ["9876543210", "person@example.com"]
}

### Request SMS template approval
POST {{host}}/api/connect/requestApproval
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Exam starts at 10 AM",
  "approve": false
}
